OL,3,GNEWSAForest recovery to take 'many
OL,4,Ayears' after wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe New Forest National Park will take
OL,7,F"many years to recover" from a wildfire
OL,8,Fthat has been burning for 10 days,
OL,9,FForestry England has said.
OL,11,FA major incident was declared after a
OL,12,Fvan fire on the A31 near Ringwood,
OL,13,FHampshire, spread and destroyed about
OL,14,F1.6 sq km (0.6 sq miles) of heathland.
OL,16,FHighways England said the affected
OL,17,Fstretch of dual carriageway needed
OL,18,Fsignificant repairs, including about
OL,19,F1km (0.6 miles) of boundary fencing and
OL,20,Fhundreds of metres of barrier.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
