OL,3,GNEWSAForest recovery to take 'many
OL,4,Ayears' after wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said work had already begun but the
OL,7,Froad, the main route through the New
OL,8,FForest, was expected to remain closed
OL,9,Fin both directions until at least
OL,10,FThursday.
